sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Customer on WhatsApp
  participant WA as whatsapp-flows-service
  participant API as Orchestrator API
  participant TS as Temporal server
  participant TQ as Task Queue CERN_WORKFLOW_ORCH
  participant W as Worker (YamlWorkflowImpl)
  participant DB as Postgres orch.customers

  Note over C,W: The workflow is inside await-day1: a 3 day timer is running (until the next scheduled contact, Day 4)

  C->>WA: taps the answer in the Flow
  WA->>WA: webhook, map the answer to a feedback type
  WA->>API: POST /workflows/OUTREACH_20_DAY-C1002/feedback
  API->>TS: SignalWorkflow feedback(type, remindAfter, channel)
  Note over TS: history gets WorkflowExecutionSignaled
  TS->>TQ: schedule Workflow Task
  TQ-->>W: Workflow Task
  Note over W: feedback() adds the signal to the pending queue, await() sees it
  W->>TS: command CancelTimer (the 3 day timer)

  alt POSITIVE
    W->>TS: ScheduleActivityTask sendMessage thank-you
    TS->>TQ: Activity Task
    TQ-->>W: Activity Task, WhatsApp text sent
    W->>TS: command CompleteWorkflowExecution
  else REMIND_LATER with remindAfter 3d
    W->>TS: command StartTimer 3 days (remindAfter 3d, 1 day if none asked)
    TS->>TQ: TimerFired, Workflow Task
    W->>TS: ScheduleActivityTask checkCustomerFlag (contactGuard)
    TS->>TQ: Activity Task
    TQ-->>W: Activity Task checkCustomerFlag
    W->>DB: SELECT balance_maintained for the customer
    DB-->>W: true or false
    alt balance_maintained is true
      W->>TS: ScheduleActivityTask sendMessage thank-you-balance
      W->>TS: command CompleteWorkflowExecution
    else false
      W->>TS: ScheduleActivityTask sendMessage remind-day1
      W->>TS: StartTimer 1 day (to answer the reminder)
      Note over W: then continues with the next scheduled contact
    end
  else INCONCLUSIVE or no answer in time
    Note over W: no command for the switch step, goes straight to wait-day-4
    W->>TS: command StartTimer until Day 4, 10:00 IST
    Note over W,DB: at Day 4 the same checkCustomerFlag read runs before contact-day4
  end

  Note over W,TS: Before every contact except Day 1 the worker runs the contactGuard activity checkCustomerFlag, a fresh read of balance_maintained<br/>If it is true the contact is skipped and thank-you-balance is sent
